Z||000000||stimpy||01-29-2001||10:05 AM||||<BR>OK, y'all caught me nappin. I thought I knew all the hip Fiero lingo until recently. Now everypost I turn around I see references to STDI and STDII Fieros. What the heck does that mean?  I know we recently had the thread on sex in Fieros, are these types of transmittable diseases you can only catch by doin it in a Fiero?<P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||5
