Z||000012||Standard||01-30-2001||12:34 AM||||TDC means Top Dead Center and Twin Dual Cam..<P>Twin Dual Cam is the same as Dual OverHead Cam when used in V-type engines... pretty much a redundent term.  I think they use it because it's easier to say "3.4 TDC" than "3.4 DOHC"...||||reg||
